# seed/omc/sites/sites.cases: one refusal fixture for each omc error site that no other tracked input reached
# (ROADMAP-1.0 RM8). Each was found unreached by seed/omc/sitecov.sh and shown reached by its mutant (the
# site's code changed to 97 makes omc exit 97 on the fixture). Run by seed/qualification/om2/every.sh.
